<title>UK: UK's Signet yr pretax profit rises 80 pct.</title>
<headline>UK's Signet yr pretax profit rises 80 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>British jewellery retailer Signet Group Plc said on Wednesday that its pretax profits for the year to February 1, 1997 rose 80 percent to 45.1 million stg from 25.02 million in the previous year.  </p>
<p>Signet said its operating profit rose 20 percent to 76.5 million stg from 63.9 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company's net debt fell to 240.2 million stg from 308.2 million in the same period.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
